Senior analysts are not better because they know more syntax — they’re better because they frame reality.


KPI (Key Performance Indicator)
A metric that directly reflects progress toward a business objective.


KPI Rule 

If a metric does not influence a decision, it is NOT a KPI.


❌ Bad Analyst

“Revenue increased by 12%.”

✅ Strong Analyst

“Revenue increased by 12%, driven primarily by high-value crypto transactions, increasing dependency risk on a single category.”

Same data.
Different level
